# Push to aditis1017/Aramex

Follow [`.cursor/skills/github-aramex-push/SKILL.md`](../skills/github-aramex-push/SKILL.md).

- Remote: `github` → `https://github.com/aditis1017/Aramex.git`
- A push that includes `.github/workflows/aramex-ci.yml` starts GitHub Actions.
- Do not push to `origin` as part of this workflow.
- A commit message is required when there are changes to publish.
